---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);

const title = 'Cooker and Oven Repair in Varna | RotoRem';
const description = 'Professional cooker and oven repair in Varna - Fast in-home repair the same day - Quality guarantee - Contact us at 089 834 0982!';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-orange-800 text-white py-16 mb-16">
      <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          Cooker and Oven Repair in Varna
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-orange-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Professional electric oven and cooktop repair in Varna and surrounding areas. Fast on-site service with quality guarantee.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-orange-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Visit and diagnostics in Varna - 20.46 EUR (40 BGN)
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-orange-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+359 89 834 0982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container max-w-4xl">

      <!-- Why Choose Us Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why choose our oven repair service in Varna?</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-orange-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-orange-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-orange-900 mb-3">Fast on-site repair</h3>
            <p class="text-orange-800">Our technician comes directly to your home in Varna to repair your oven. We repair built-in and freestanding ovens.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-red-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-red-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-900 mb-3">Same-day repair</h3>
            <p class="text-red-800">In most cases we repair ovens the same day in Varna. Quick diagnosis and efficient problem resolution.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Quality guarantee</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-800">All oven repairs in Varna are performed with a guarantee for work quality and parts used.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-yellow-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-yellow-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-yellow-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-900 mb-3">Service throughout Varna</h3>
            <p class="text-yellow-800">We repair ovens in neighborhoods: Chayka, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik and Varna center.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-50 to-rose-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-rose-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"/><path d="M7 16h10"/><path d="M7 8h10"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-rose-900 mb-3">All oven brands</h3>
            <p class="text-rose-800">We repair electric ovens from all brands: Bosch, Siemens, Electrolux, Whirlpool, Indesit, Beko and others.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-pink-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-pink-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-pink-900 mb-3">Fair prices</h3>
            <p class="text-pink-800">Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20.46 EUR (40 BGN). Clear prices with no hidden fees for oven repair in Varna.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Common Problems Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Most common oven problems in Varna</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-orange-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-50 via-white to-orange-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-orange-100">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-orange-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-orange-900 mb-3">Oven not heating</h3>
              <p class="text-orange-800">Damaged heating elements, thermostat or control board. Diagnosis and parts replacement.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-red-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-red-900 mb-3">Oven not maintaining temperature</h3>
              <p class="text-red-800">Problem with thermostat, sensors or insulation. Professional repair in Varna.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-amber-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Light not working</h3>
              <p class="text-amber-800">Burnt bulb or damaged lighting system. Replacement with original parts.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-yellow-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-yellow-900 mb-3">Oven not turning on</h3>
              <p class="text-yellow-800">Electrical problems, damaged contacts or control board. Diagnosis and repair.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-rose-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-rose-900 mb-3">Door not closing properly</h3>
              <p class="text-rose-800">Damaged hinges, seals or locking system. We restore full functionality.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-pink-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-pink-900 mb-3">Timer not working</h3>
              <p class="text-pink-800">Problems with electronic control or display. Repair of electronic components.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Oven Types Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Types of ovens we repair in Varna</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-orange-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-orange-200">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M7 16h10"/>
                <path d="M7 8h10"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-orange-900 mb-4 text-center">Built-in ovens</h3>
            <p class="text-orange-800 text-center">Repair of built-in electric ovens all brands. We work with convection, grill and other functions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-red-100 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-red-200">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M3 9h18"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-red-900 mb-4 text-center">Freestanding ovens</h3>
            <p class="text-red-800 text-center">Repair of freestanding ovens and cooktops with oven. All sizes and brands.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
                <path d="m12 1 3 6 6 3-6 3-3 6-3-6-6-3 6-3z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-4 text-center">Convection ovens</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-800 text-center">Specialized repair of convection ovens. Repair of fans and control systems.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-yellow-100 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-yellow-200">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-yellow-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-900 mb-4 text-center">Ovens with grill</h3>
            <p class="text-yellow-800 text-center">Repair of grill elements and roasting functions. Restoration of all programs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Brands Section - Clean text-focused approach -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Oven brands we repair in Varna</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-orange-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            {[
              'Bosch', 'Siemens', 'Electrolux', 'Whirlpool', 
              'Beko', 'Indesit', 'Gorenje', 'Other brands'
            ].map((brand) => (
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-200 group hover:border-orange-300">
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
                  {brand}
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  {brand === 'Other brands' ? 'All other brands' : `${brand} repair service`}
                </p>
                <div class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center text-xs text-orange-600">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
                    <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
                  </svg>
                  Certified service
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-orange-800 text-white p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Need oven repair in Varna?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-orange-100">Call now for fast on-site repair!</p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-orange-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+359 89 834 0982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-orange-100">
          <p class="text-sm">
            Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20.46 EUR (40 BGN) | Quality guarantee | Service in Varna
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

<!-- SEO helper text -->
      <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
        <p>Is your oven not heating, your cooker not turning on, or food staying undercooked? These are common issues that require quick response. We provide professional in-home cooker, cooktop, and oven repair in Varna. We work across the city and nearby areas, with the goal of restoring normal operation as early as the first visit.</p>
        <h2>What cooker and oven faults we repair in Varna</h2>
        <p>With daily use, kitchen appliances are heavily loaded and different faults appear. Most often, oven repair is needed for heating issues when the unit does not reach temperature or bakes unevenly. We also handle cases where the cooker does not start or turns off during operation.</p>
        <p>Common causes include faulty thermostats and burned heating elements. We also perform oven fan repairs when hot air is not distributed correctly. For electric cookers, we address cooktop, switch, and electronics issues.</p>
        <p>We repair built-in ovens as well, including display, programmer, and door problems. If the appliance stops suddenly, we identify the cause and provide a practical solution. We also offer built-in oven installation for new purchases or replacements.</p>
        <p>If needed, you can rely on us for microwave repairs and other home appliances too. For dishwashers, see our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/dishwasher-repair/">dishwasher repair</a> service, and for home electrical issues, our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/electrical-services/">electrical services</a>. All services for the area are listed on our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/">Varna services page</a>.</p>
        <h2>Which cooker and oven brands we service in Varna</h2>
        <p>We work with all popular brands including Gorenje, Bosch, Whirlpool, Beko, Indesit, and others. Whether it is a standard cooker or a modern built-in oven, we have practical experience with different models and systems, which enables faster and more accurate repair.</p>
        <h2>Areas in Varna we cover</h2>
        <p>We provide cooker and oven repair in all districts of Varna and nearby settlements. We serve Chaika, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Galata, and central Varna, as well as locations within about 20 km.</p>
        <h2>How the repair process works</h2>
        <p>The process begins with on-site inspection and diagnostics. The technician checks the appliance and identifies the exact cause of the fault. Then you receive a clear quote without hidden conditions. After approval, we proceed with the repair, often during the same visit.</p>
        <p>After completion, we run tests to ensure everything works correctly. The goal is to restore full operation quickly and reliably, without unnecessary repeat visits or costs.</p>
        <h2>Why choose RotoRem for oven and cooker service</h2>
        <p>Clients choose us for our practical approach and clear communication. We work at your address, which saves time and transport. We have experience with different generations of cookers and ovens, provide warranty for completed repairs, and use proven parts. Prices are transparent and timelines are realistic. <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/contact/">Contact us</a> now and book a convenient visit.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

